  "description": "XESCAD crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H98 Ho8 N6 O32,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho1A (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2A (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho3A (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho4A (Ho) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 18 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.581-4.014 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.52-116.49°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H100Ho8N8O32. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
